# Benchmark evidence IS committed — the reports, per-run records, gate results and
# sweep logs are what the findings in PROGRESS.md rest on, and they cannot be
# regenerated without ~20 hours of model time.
#
# Two exclusions, both regenerable working state rather than evidence:
#   - each block copies the corpus snapshot and mutates it as it runs (alert status,
#     persisted reports); the reports are exported as JSON alongside, so the copy
#     carries nothing the committed files do not. 23 copies, 20MB of the 26MB total.
#   - *.db above already excludes them; this is the explicit note about why.
bench/results/**/alerts.db
